# Used with: scripts/e2e.sh tests/e2e/search.actions -- target/debug/temzdf standalone pdf --clean target/fixtures/sample.pdf
# Judged (expect: each screen compared with --render-frame replaying the same
# input): typing shows the prompt with incremental highlights (typing),
# Enter + n moves to the next hit (next), Esc clears highlights (cleared).
keys slash
type needle
pause 0.8
expect typing
keys Return n
pause 0.8
expect next
keys Escape
pause 0.5
expect cleared
